  "content": "[Intro]\n[Em/G]  [Em]\n[Em/G]  [Em]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Em][Em/G]Remember that\n[Am]night White\n[Cmaj7]steps in the moon-\n[Bm7]light\n[Em/G][Em]They walked here\n[Am]too Through empty\n[Cmaj7]playground, this\n[Bm7]ghosts\n[B7]town\n[Em/G][Em]Children again,\n[Am]on rusting\n[Cmaj7]swings getting\n[Bm7]higher\n[Em/G][Em]Sharing a dream,\n[Am]on an is-\n[Cmaj7]land, it\n[Bm7]felt\n[B7]right\nWe\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Em]lay side by [Bm]side Between the\n[Dm]moon and the tide [Am]\n[Cm]Mapping the stars [Gm]for a while\n[A7]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Cmaj7/G]Let the night surround\nyou\nWe're halfway to the\nstars\nEbb and flow\nLet it go\nFeel her warmth beside\nyou\n\n[Solo 1]\n[Em9]\n[C]\n[Em9]\n[Fmaj7]\n[Em9]\n[C]\n[Em9]\n[Fmaj7]\n[Em9]\n[C]\n[Em9]\n[Fmaj7]\n[Em9]\n[C]\n[Em9]\n[Fmaj7]\n[G]\n[Em]  [Bm]\n[Dm]  [Am]\n[Cm]  [Gm]\n[A7]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Em][Em/G]Remember that\n[Am]night The\n[Cmaj7]warmth and the laugh-\n[Bm7]ter\n[Em/G][Em]Candles\n[Am]burned Though the church\n[Cmaj7]was deser-\n[Bm7]\n[B7]ted\n[Em/G]At dawn [Em]we went down\n[Am]Through empty\n[Cmaj7]streets to the har-\n[Bm7]bour\n[Em/G][Em]Dreamers may\n[Am]leave, but they're\n[Cmaj7]here ever af-\n[Bm7]\n[B7]ter\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Bm][Em]Lalalala\n[Am][Dm]Lalalala\n[Gm][Cm]Lalalala\n[A7]\n\n[Chorus]\n[Cmaj7/G]Let the night surround\nyou\nWe're halfway to the\nstars\nEbb and flow\nLet it go\nFeel her warmth beside\nyou\n\n[Solo 2]\n[Em/G]  [Em]\n[Am]\n[Cmaj7]\n[Bm7]\n[Em/G]  [Em]\n[Am]\n[Cmaj7]\n[Bm7]\n[B7]\n[Em/G]  [Em]\n[Am]\n[Cmaj7]\n[Bm7]\n[Em/G]  [Em]\n[Am]\n[Cmaj7]\n[Bm7]\n[B7]\n[Em/G]  [Em]\n[Am]\n[Cmaj7]\n[Bm7]\n[Em/G]  [Em]\n[Am]\n[Cmaj7]\n[Bm7]\n[B7]\n\n[Fade Out]\n[Em/G]  [Em]\n[Am]\n[Cmaj7]\n[Bm7]\n[Em/G]  [Em]\n[Am]\n[Cmaj7]\n[Bm7]\n[B7]",
